{"id": "De_6VqvS-qj", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Part 2 of 2. Shadow puppet animation.\n\nShri Ram's murti was stolen from Ayodhya. Nobody saw the thief come, nobody saw him go. 🕯️\n\nPahari Baba gave the task to his disciple Damodar Das. It is said he had gutka siddhi, a pill that could take a man anywhere. He waited in Ayodhya for months, and one night the temple was empty. A priest with the same power chased him to Haridwar and put all his strength into lifting the murti. It did not move. Damodar lifted it with one hand.\n\nIn July 1651 the murti reached Kullu and the curse lifted. Raja gave his throne to Raghunath ji and became his chharibardar, his servant. That is why Kullu's Dussehra begins on the day the rest of India's ends. And here Ravana is not burnt. Lanka is.\n\n#jaishreeram🚩 #kulludussehra #himachalpradesh❤️ #ayodhya #tholubommalata", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1793106069, "like_count": 9315, "comment_count": 36, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-877465958725575a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 68.83, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNNu5dWkSbRdTi0qPH32wrno_8jJ9ccv4h_lm2HoxYVX9uNzZ-bnx2GzRYU8YVuSG1SEYZ9dujHqlsoZQq53Wyk2ZOXE067OHCfJNw.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdqIv8xUC2ULEY_Gg8NkWctHplVjo2FmPajqcBLJ-5_RWMEnMGz5O6iyRhiZC0QgX3vgnrg9tBm1BGSlrugxKk3f&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=whpFZRt_D5wQ7kNvwHbMiC7&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=vVi2xNjwUDz5zBWXxzTRIA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQKlM0zEra3_zGdWKGU6GYOwEMmD6dr3E5dUkYeXgW13w&oe=6AF42896", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 68.83, "resolution": "audio only", "http_hea